<title>ALBANIA: SOCCER-ALBANIA AND ARMENIA DRAW 1-1 IN WORLD CUP QUALIFIER.</title>
<headline>SOCCER-ALBANIA AND ARMENIA DRAW 1-1 IN WORLD CUP QUALIFIER.</headline>
<dateline>TIRANA 1996-11-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>Albania and Armenia drew 1-1 (halftime 0-0) in their World Cup European group nine qualifying match on Saturday.</p>
<p>Scorers:</p>
<p>Albania - Bajram Fraholli 58</p>
<p>Armenia - Hakob Ter-Petrosyan 90</p>
<p>Attendance: 7,000  </p>
<p>Group nine standings (tabulated - played, won, drawn, lost,</p>
<p>goals for, goals against, points):</p>
<p> Ukraine		2   2   0   0   3   1   6</p>
<p> Portugal	     3   1   1   1   4   2   4</p>
<p> Germany		1   1   0   0   5   1   3</p>
<p> Armenia		4   0   3   1   3   7   3</p>
<p> Northern Ireland   2   0   1   1   1   2   1</p>
<p> Albania		2   0   2   1   1   4   1</p>
</text>
